# The repository root .gitignore globally ignores package-lock.json, but this
# package must commit its lockfile: `npm ci` (run by CI and by T-1-1) refuses to
# start without one, and the pinned dependency tree is part of the build
# contract (AD-25, plan Step 1). Re-include it here for this package only.
# node_modules/ and dist/ stay ignored via the root .gitignore.
!package-lock.json

# The root .gitignore ignores any directory named `build/`, which also swallows
# test/build/ — the compile-time test tier (tsc_fixture, package_build,
# typecheck_provenance) and its must-fail fixtures. That is committed source, not
# build output (the compiled output lives under dist/, which stays ignored).
# Re-include the whole test/build/ subtree for this package.
!test/build/
!test/build/**
